# Schema Normalizer

Denormalize edilmiş düz veriyi, veritabanı normalizasyon kurallarına göre normalize edin.

## İstenilen Fonksiyon: `normalize(data, entityName)`

Denormalize flat data'yı normalized entities'e ayırır.

## Örnek
Giriş (denormalize):
```javascript
[
  { orderId: 1, product: 'Laptop', category: 'Electronics', customerName: 'Ali', customerEmail: 'ali@test.com' },
  { orderId: 2, product: 'Phone', category: 'Electronics', customerName: 'Ali', customerEmail: 'ali@test.com' },
  { orderId: 3, product: 'Book', category: 'Education', customerName: 'Veli', customerEmail: 'veli@test.com' }
]
```

Çıkış (normalize):
```javascript
{
  customers: [
    { id: 1, name: 'Ali', email: 'ali@test.com' },
    { id: 2, name: 'Veli', email: 'veli@test.com' }
  ],
  categories: [
    { id: 1, name: 'Electronics' },
    { id: 2, name: 'Education' }
  ],
  orders: [
    { id: 1, product: 'Laptop', categoryId: 1, customerId: 1 },
    { id: 2, product: 'Phone', categoryId: 1, customerId: 1 },
    { id: 3, product: 'Book', categoryId: 2, customerId: 2 }
  ]
}
```

